a dog is a kind of thing with:
    name, which is text.
a cat is a kind of thing with:
    name, which is text.
a fish is a kind of thing with:
    name, which is text.
to speak, for a dog:
    say "woof".
to speak, for a cat:
    say "meow".
to speak, for a dog:
    say "woof again".
to describe, for a dog:
    say "dog".
to describe with x:
    say x.
speak (a new fish with name "Nemo").
speak 5.
let tom be a new cat with name "Tom".
say speak tom.
speak tom with 3.
